include global.rules

skip 1
fields date, action, symbol, fdesc, txntype, price, quantity, commission, fees, accruedinterest, amount, balance, settlementdate

date-format %m/%d/%Y

currency $

account1 assets:cash:fidelity
balance %balance

# Fidelity's own Description column is always "No Description" or the
# generic fund name — the meaningful text is in Action. Default to that,
# then override with something more readable per case below.
description %action

# Reinvestment of that same dividend back into the money-market fund is a
# same-day wash with no net effect in our flat "SPAXX = cash" model — skip
# it rather than post a no-op transfer to itself.
if REINVESTMENT
    skip

# Chase autopay from this account (mirrors the Chase-side rule) — routed
# through the same clearing account so both sides net to zero.
if DIRECT DEBIT CHASE CREDIT
    account2 equity:transfers
    description Chase Credit Card autopay

if
%date The data and information in this spreadsheet is provided to you solely for your use and is not for distribution. The spreadsheet is provided for
%date informational purposes only, and is not intended to provide advice, nor should it be construed as an offer to sell, a solicitation of an offer to buy or a
%date recommendation for any security or insurance product by Fidelity or any third party. Data and information shown is based on information known to Fidelity as of the date it was
%date exported and is subject to change. It should not be used in place of your account statements or trade confirmations and is not intended for tax reporting
%date purposes. For more information on the data included in this spreadsheet, including any limitations thereof, go to Fidelity.com.
%date Brokerage services are provided by Fidelity Brokerage Services LLC \(FBS\), 900 Salem Street, Smithfield, RI 02917. Custody and other services provided by National
%date Financial Services LLC \(NFS\). Both are Fidelity Investment companies and members SIPC, NYSE. Insurance products at Fidelity are distributed by
%date Fidelity Insurance Agency, Inc., and, for certain products, by Fidelity Brokerage Services, Member NYSE, SIPC.
%date Date downloaded
    skip 1
